<title>USA: PSH to buy up to 30,000 more Penske shares.</title>
<headline>PSH to buy up to 30,000 more Penske shares.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSH Corp said Tuesday it intends to buy up to 30,000 additional shares of Penske Motorsports Inc common stock.</p>
<p>PSH currently owns 60 percent of the Penske outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
